{"id":"9cfd16aeed","t":"A Fractured Marriage","c":"cv","n":6,"l":6,"s":["az"],"k":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage"},"u":1795077459961,"desc":"\"شريكُ عمري لِعقدٍ من الزمان سيتزوج بأخرى، ومع ذلك.. لم ننفصل بعد! أيُعقل أن يحدث هذا حقًا؟\" وفي غمرة اليأس القاتم الذي هَوت إليه «هيو ريم» بسبب هذا الواقع المرير، يلوح في أفقها غريبٌ غامض يمدّ إلي...","type":"","status":"","genres":[],"src":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage"},"chapters":{"1":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-1"},"2":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-2"},"3":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-3"},"4":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-4"},"5":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-5"},"6":{"az":"a-fractured-marriage|/series/a-fractured-marriage/chapter-6"}}}